<title>USA: Dynamics say directors call bid &quot;inadequate&quot;.</title>
<headline>Dynamics say directors call bid &quot;inadequate&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamics Corp of America said Monday the &quot;unanimous initial reaction&quot; of its directors to WHX Corp's $40 a share cash merger offer, except for one who could not be reached, was that it was &quot;totally inadequate.&quot;</p>
<p>In a statement, Dynamics confirmed it received the unsolicited offer on March 27.  It said it acknowledged receipt of WHX's letter-offer on the same day and advised WHX it would inform its directors and respond this week.</p>
</text>
